  "description": "Numerics.NET (formerly Extreme Optimization Numerical Libraries for .NET) are a set of libraries for numerical computing and data analysis.\n\nThis bundle includes the managed Numerics.NET packages and the preferred Apple Accelerate native provider for macOS, supporting Intel x64 and Apple Silicon ARM64 in both single and double precision.\n\nManaged targets include .NET 8, .NET 9, .NET 10, .NET Framework 4.6.2+, and .NET Standard 2.0. The native provider requires macOS.",
